        "raw": "<p>I am sure this has come up before so forgive my newbieness.&nbsp; When a card states that it can target more than one card, or &quot;up&quot; to a certain number of targets, are you allowed to choose the same target card more than once during the effect?&nbsp; An example would be inflict 2 damage on up to two targets.&nbsp; Can the same target be chosen 2x?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for the info!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Razman</p>",
