        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>&nbsp;So this has got to do with kismet more ( but still targeting). So if any card is played (jinx, etc) that stays with a hero....if the text puts it initially with a target with the most hp and during play they no longer are the target with the most hp... Will that card actually move around?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;Just came up with our game last night as we had multiple jinx&#39;s and just played where they stayed on the target the initially attatched too.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;In addition do any cards like that specifically affect a hero target character.....will they also affect all ( say unity&#39;s golems) their powers by other targets?</p><p>&nbsp;Any light shed would be greatly appreciated. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Thanks</p>",
