        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-28T16:42:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1) No, the jinxes don't move around, they stay on the hero they were played on until they are destroyed.</p><p>2) If you mean what I think you mean (would Shaky Arm, for example, lower the damage dealt by Unity's golems) then no; the Jinxes only affect the character they're played on, and not any other targets.</p>",
